# Final case-analysis outputs are derived from credentialed patient-level data
# and are private by default. Keep only the two source-code artifacts currently
# stored in this directory; if they are moved to case_multivar/, the exceptions
# below can be removed and analysis_final/ can be ignored wholesale.
case_multivar/analysis_final/*
!case_multivar/analysis_final/rfbbp_case_final.ipynb
!case_multivar/analysis_final/rfbbp_helpers.py

